    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "John Giltinane Auctioneer & Associates are delighted to bring to the market this spacious detached 6-bedroom residence on c. 0.74 Acres\r\nLocated in the peaceful countryside setting of Castlegrey, Kildimo, this substantial detached six-bedroom residence sits on a generous site extending to approximately 0.74 acres, offering excellent space both inside and out. The property presents an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a spacious home in a convenient rural location, while also benefiting from potential eligibility for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant and SEAI energy efficiency grants (subject to relevant terms and conditions).\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprised of :\r\n-Kitchen\r\nTimber fitted kitchen with lino flooring.\r\n11.40 ft x 17.69 ft (c. 202.94 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\n-Utility Room\r\nConvenient utility room with access to the rear of the property.\r\n6.63 ft x 4.96 ft (c. 32.89 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\n-Sitting / Dining Room\r\nBright and spacious reception room featuring an open fireplace and sliding patio doors which allow an abundance of natural light into the room.\r\n11.53 ft x 14.97 ft (c. 172.57 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\n-Sitting Room\r\nGenerous reception room with feature fireplace.\r\n13.88 ft x 17.93 ft (c. 248.94 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\n-Bedroom 1\r\nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobe and newly renovated ensuite bathroom complete with walk-in shower.\r\n12.35 ft x 10.62 ft (c. 131.10 sq. ft.)\r\nEnsuite\r\nNewly renovated with walk-in shower.\r\n\r\n-Main Bathroom\r\nShower only.\r\n6.60 ft x 5.27 ft (c. 34.78 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\n-Bedroom 2\r\nDouble bedroom.\r\n8.91 ft x 11.38 ft (c. 101.41 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\n-Bedroom 3\r\n7.21 ft x 9.96 ft (c. 71.81 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\n-Bedroom 4\r\n10.21 ft x 16.69 ft (c. 170.46 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\n-Bedroom 5\r\n10.28 ft x 9.96 ft (c. 102.39 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\n-Bedroom 6 / Playroom\r\n10.01 ft x 9.92 ft (c. 99.37 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\n-Bathroom\r\nBath only.\r\n5.55 ft x 8.58 ft (c. 47.67 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nThe property is situated on a generous c. 0.74-acre site with mature grounds, ample parking and plenty of outdoor space. The setting offers the perfect balance of countryside living while remaining within easy reach of Kildimo Village and local amenities.\r\n\r\nThe property is located only a short drive from Curraghchase Forest Park, a popular destination renowned for its woodland walks, scenic trails, lakes, playground and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\n*Features*\r\n-Detached 6-bedroom residence\r\n-c. 0.74-acre site\r\n-Newly renovated ensuite with walk-in shower\r\n-Spacious and versatile accommodation\r\n-Eligible for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant (subject to approval)\r\n-Potential eligibility for SEAI energy upgrade grants\r\n-Convenient location close to Kildimo Village\r\n-Easy access to Limerick City, Adare and the N69\r\n-Close to Curraghchase Forest Park\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment."
      },
